---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout title="Credits — Numlore" description="Third-party data sources Numlore builds on.">
  <article class="max-w-prose space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl tracking-tight">Credits</h1>

    <p>Numlore builds on the following third-party data sources and libraries.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">CMU Pronouncing Dictionary</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--text-dim)]">
        ARPAbet phonetic transcriptions for approximately 134,000 English words.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Princeton WordNet 3.1</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--text-dim)]">
        Lexical database providing parts of speech and semantic hierarchies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">wordfreq</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--text-dim)]">
        Used at build time to compute Zipf word frequency. Development dependency only.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Brysbaert, Warriner, & Kuperman (2014)</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--text-dim)]">
        Concreteness ratings for 40,000 generally known English word lemmas. Behavior Research Methods, 46(3), 904–911.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Glyphex</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--text-dim)]">
        Aggregate page analytics. The only third-party script Numlore loads — used to count visits, not to identify visitors. See <a class="underline" href="/privacy">/privacy</a> for the contract.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
